                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR VIDEOCODIERUNG ZUR DREIECKSVORHERSAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS ET APPAREIL DE CODAGE VIDÉO POUR PRÉDICTION DE TRIANGLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHODS AND APPARATUS OF VIDEO CODING FOR TRIANGLE PREDICTION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for video decoding comprising: obtaining video pictures, wherein the video pictures are partitioned into a plurality of coding units (CUs), at least one of which is further partitioned into two prediction units (PUs); determining whether a Merge mode with Motion Vector Difference (MMVD) prediction mode and a triangle prediction mode are enabled; in response to determining that the MMVD prediction mode and the triangle prediction mode are enabled, obtaining Motion Vector Difference (MVD) related syntax elements under the MMVD prediction mode for a triangle PU in a current CU.</p>
            </abstract>
